<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Living Carapace</ansi> mutation

Your whole body seals inside a thick, living shell that grows and
repairs itself endlessly.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Transformation (apex)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Apex
<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi> Thick Hide and Regrowth

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Tremendous natural armor, blows that strike the carapace are hurled
  back with a vengeance, you cannot be knocked down or grappled, and
  enemies are drawn to attack you first

